            <div id="home-board-movers" class="home-board-movers">
              <div class="home-board-loading">로딩 중...</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <!-- 아툴 검색 인구 주간 변동 (홈 전용) -->
    <p id="hpop-title" class="badge" style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem; margin-top: 0 !important; padding-top: 0 !important;">
      📈 아툴 검색 인구 주간 변동
      <span id="hpop-period" style="font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 400; margin-left: 0.5rem;"></span>
      <a class="hpop-more" href="/statistics/population" style="margin-left: 0.5rem;">전체 보기 ›</a>
    </p>
    <div id="hpop-section" class="card-grid" style="grid-column: 1 / -1; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      <article class="hero-card" style="grid-column: 1 / -1;">
        <div id="hpop-body">
          <div class="hpop-loading">로딩 중...</div>
        </div>
        <div class="hpop-note"><b>검색 인구</b>는 최근 30일 안에 아툴에서 조회된 캐릭터 수입니다. 아툴에서 검색된 캐릭터만 표본이라 실제 서버 인구와는 차이가 있을 수 있습니다.</div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <!-- 아이온2 진행중인 이벤트 섹션 (홈 화면 전용) -->
    <p id="coupon-title" class="badge" style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem; margin-top: 0 !important; padding-top: 0 !important;">
      🎁 아이온2 시즌3 진행중인 이벤트
    </p>
    <div id="coupon-section" class="card-grid" style="grid-column: 1 / -1; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      <article class="hero-card" style="grid-column: 1 / -1; padding: 1rem 1.25rem;">
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.6rem;">
          <!-- 쿠폰: SUMMER FESTA -->
          <div class="coupon-item" data-start-kst="2026-06-14T18:00:00" data-end-kst="2026-09-30T10:00:00" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; padding: 0.6rem 0.9rem; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px;">
            <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 0;">
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                <span style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; color: #e2e0ff;">SUMMER FESTA 기념 쿠폰코드</span>
                <code style="font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 700; color: #a78bfa; background: rgba(157,140,255,0.13); padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; user-select: all;">AION2CHAPTERONE</code>
              </div>
              <div style="font-size: 0.72rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);">6월 14일 (일) 18시 ~ 9월 30일 (수) 정기점검 전까지</div>
            </div>
            <button onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText('AION2CHAPTERONE').then(()=>{const b=this;b.textContent='✅ 복사됨';b.style.background='rgba(34,197,94,0.2)';b.style.borderColor='rgba(34,197,94,0.4)';b.style.color='#4ade80';setTimeout(()=>{b.textContent='복사';b.style.background='rgba(157,140,255,0.12)';b.style.borderColor='rgba(157,140,255,0.25)';b.style.color='#a78bfa';},3500);})" style="flex-shrink: 0; padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem; background: rgba(157,140,255,0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(157,140,255,0.25); border-radius: 6px; color: #a78bfa; font-size: 0.75rem; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s ease; white-space: nowrap;">복사</button>
          </div>
          <!-- 쿠폰: 서프라이즈 (~7/8) -->
          <div class="coupon-item" data-start-kst="2026-06-07T17:00:00" data-end-kst="2026-07-08T10:00:00" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; padding: 0.6rem 0.9rem; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px;">
            <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 0;">
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                <span style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; color: #e2e0ff;">서프라이즈 쿠폰 (~7/8)</span>
                <code style="font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 700; color: #a78bfa; background: rgba(157,140,255,0.13); padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; user-select: all;">AION2SURPRISELIVE</code>
              </div>
              <div style="font-size: 0.72rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);">6월 7일 (일) 17시 ~ 7월 8일 (수) 정기점검 전까지</div>
            </div>
            <button onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText('AION2SURPRISELIVE').then(()=>{const b=this;b.textContent='✅ 복사됨';b.style.background='rgba(34,197,94,0.2)';b.style.borderColor='rgba(34,197,94,0.4)';b.style.color='#4ade80';setTimeout(()=>{b.textContent='복사';b.style.background='rgba(157,140,255,0.12)';b.style.borderColor='rgba(157,140,255,0.25)';b.style.color='#a78bfa';},3500);})" style="flex-shrink: 0; padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem; background: rgba(157,140,255,0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(157,140,255,0.25); border-radius: 6px; color: #a78bfa; font-size: 0.75rem; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s ease; white-space: nowrap;">복사</button>
          </div>
          <!-- 안내 -->
          <div style="font-size: 0.7rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); padding-left: 0.15rem;">
            복사 후, 게임 내 설정 → 기타 → 계정 입력에서 사용하세요.
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
    <script>
    (function () {
      function parseKst(iso) {
        if (!iso) return NaN;
        return Date.parse(iso + '+09:00');
      }
      var couponItems = document.querySelectorAll('#coupon-section .coupon-item[data-end-kst]');
      var now = Date.now();
      couponItems.forEach(function (el) {
        var startTs = parseKst(el.getAttribute('data-start-kst'));
        var endTs = parseKst(el.getAttribute('data-end-kst'));
        if (!isNaN(startTs) && now < startTs) el.style.display = 'none';
        else if (!isNaN(endTs) && now >= endTs) el.style.display = 'none';
      });
    })();
    </script>
    
    
    <section class="dashboard" id="main-dashboard">
      <div class="tab-panels">
        <section id="panel-character" class="tab-panel">
          <!-- 검색 결과 표시 영역 -->
        <div id="character-result" class="card-grid" style="display: none;">
        <article class="hero-card" style="grid-column: 1 / -1; border: none;">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1.5rem; position: relative;">
            <!-- 캐릭터 아바타 이미지 -->
            <div id="result-avatar-container" style="display: none; flex-shrink: 0; min-width: 156px;">
              <img id="result-avatar" src="" alt="" style="width: 156px; height: 260px; border-radius: 16px; border: 2px solid rgba(157, 140, 255, 0.3); object-fit: cover; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); display: none;">
            </div>
            <!-- 닉네임과 스탯 -->
            <div style="flex: 1;">
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                <h3 id="result-nickname" style="margin: 0; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.5rem;"></h3>
                <button id="favorite-star-btn" style="background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer; padding: 0.25rem; display: flex; align-items: center; font-size: 1.5rem; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3); transition: all 0.2s ease;" title="즐겨찾기" onmouseover="this.style.transform='scale(1.2)'; this.style.color='#ffd700';" onmouseout="const icon = document.getElementById('favorite-star-icon'); if (icon && icon.textContent === '☆') { this.style.color='rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3)'; } this.style.transform='';">
                  <span id="favorite-star-icon">☆</span>
                </button>
                <div id="streamer-badge-container" style="display: none;"></div>
              </div>
              <!-- (갱신 버튼 행~칩 2행) 좌측 열 + 우측 비디오: 비디오 높이 = 갱신 버튼 상단 ~ 아이템레벨 행 하단 -->
              <div class="char-chips-media" style="display: flex; align-items: stretch; gap: 1rem;">
              <div style="flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0;">
              <!-- 업데이트 시간 및 갱신 버튼 -->
              <div id="character-update-info" style="display: none; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                <span id="character-update-time" style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted);"></span>
                <style>
                  /* 갱신하기 버튼: 눈에 띄는 CTA (아이콘은 ::before — JS가 textContent를 바꿔도 유지) */
                  #character-refresh-btn {
                    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.35rem;
                    padding: 0.45rem 1rem;
                    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #a78bfa);
                    border: none; border-radius: 9px;
                    color: #fff; font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.01em;
                    cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s ease;
                    box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.45);
                  }
                  #character-refresh-btn::before { content: '🔄'; font-size: 0.85em; }
                  #character-refresh-btn:hover:not(:disabled) {
                    filter: brightness(1.12);
                    transform: translateY(-1px);
                    box-shadow: 0 5px 16px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.6);
                  }
                  #character-refresh-btn:active:not(:disabled) { transform: translateY(0); }
                </style>
                <button id="character-refresh-btn">갱신하기</button>
                <span id="character-refresh-cooldown" style="font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--text-muted); display: none;"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="companion-badge-row" id="companion-badges" style="display: none;">
                <div class="companion-badge" id="pet-badge" style="display: none;">
                  <img id="pet-icon" alt="펫 아이콘" />
                  <div>
                    <div class="companion-badge-name" id="pet-name"></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="companion-badge" id="wing-badge" style="display: none;">
                  <img id="wing-icon" alt="날개 아이콘" />
                  <div>
                    <div class="companion-badge-name" id="wing-name"></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p class="subtitle" id="result-subtitle" style="display: none;"></p>
              
              <!-- 첫 번째 줄: 종족, 서버, 직업 (3개) -->
              <div class="hero-stats hero-stats-first" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); margin-bottom: 0.4rem;">
                <div class="stat-chip">
                  <span class="label">종족</span>
                  <span class="value" id="result-race" style="font-weight: 600;"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-chip">
                  <span class="label">서버</span>
                  <span class="value" id="result-server"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-chip">
                  <span class="label">직업</span>
                  <span class="value" id="result-job-container" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.3rem;">
                    <img id="result-job-image" src="" alt="" style="width: 24px; height: 24px; display: none; flex-shrink: 0;">
                    <span id="result-job"></span>
                  </span>
                </div>
              </div>
              
              <!-- 두 번째 줄: 레기온, 전투력 (2개) -->
              <div class="hero-stats hero-stats-second" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);">
                <div class="stat-chip" style="position: relative;">
                  <span class="label">레기온</span>
                  <span class="value" id="result-guild">-</span>
                  <div id="result-guild-rank" style="font-size: 0.65rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 0.15rem;"></div>
                  <a id="region-search-link" class="region-search-desktop" href="#" style="display: none; position: absolute; bottom: 0.2rem; right: 0.3rem; font-size: 0.65rem; color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: opacity 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.opacity='0.7'" onmouseout="this.style.opacity='1'">레기온 검색 &gt;&gt;</a>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-chip">
                  <span class="label">아이템 레벨</span>
                  <span class="value" id="result-combat-power"></span>
                </div>
              </div>
              </div><!-- /칩 2행 열 -->
              
              <!-- 비디오 광고(slot-5): 칩 2행 높이에 stretch로 딱 맞춤, 폭은 16:9 자동.
                   노출/숨김은 setSearchVideoActive(Venatus 방법2) -->
              <div id="char-search-video" class="char-search-video" aria-label="광고"><div id="slot-5"></div></div>
              
              </div><!-- /.char-chips-media -->
              <!-- 레기온 검색 링크 (모바일용) -->
              <div class="region-search-mobile" style="display: none; text-align: center; margin-top: 0.3rem;">
                <a id="region-search-link-mobile" href="#" style="display: none; font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: opacity 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.opacity='0.7'" onmouseout="this.style.opacity='1'">레기온 검색 &gt;&gt;</a>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <style>
              /* 검색결과 비디오(slot-5): 칩 2행(.char-chips-media) 높이에 stretch → 높이 딱 일치, 폭은 16:9 자동.
                 (광고 소재 내부 텍스트 오버레이가 작은 폭에서 잘려 보이는 건 소재 자체의 반응형 동작 — 컨테이너 크롭 아님) */
              .char-search-video { flex: 0 0 auto; align-self: stretch; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
                width: auto; height: auto;
                border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; position: relative; }
              .char-search-video iframe, .char-search-video > div, .char-search-video > div > div,
              .char-search-video > div > div > div { width: 100% !important; height: 100% !important; }
              /* 좁은 화면·스펙업 린 모드에선 숨김 (기본정보 폭 확보) */
              @media (max-width: 1150px) { .char-search-video { display: none; } }
              body.specup-mode .char-search-video { display: none !important; }
              /* 데스크탑: 비교 버튼을 카드 우상단 absolute → 정보 열(칩+비디오)이 카드 전체 폭 사용 */
              @media (min-width: 1151px) {
                #char-top-actions { position: absolute; top: 0; right: 0; }
              }
            </style>
            
            <!-- 우측 상단 액션 영역 (데스크탑에선 카드 우상단 absolute → 정보 열이 전체 폭 사용) -->
            <div id="char-top-actions" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-end; gap: 0.75rem;">
              <a id="compare-with-mine-button" class="compare-with-mine-button" href="#" style="display: none;">
                내 캐릭터랑 비교 &gt;
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- 전투력 / 아툴 점수 보기 토글 (검색 결과 표시 시 JS로 노출) -->
          <div class="char-stat-toggle" id="char-stat-toggle" style="display: none;" role="tablist" aria-label="보기 전환">
            <button type="button" class="char-stat-toggle-btn active" data-view="power" role="tab" onclick="setCharStatView('power')">전투력</button>
            <button type="button" class="char-stat-toggle-btn" data-view="score" role="tab" onclick="setCharStatView('score')">아툴 점수</button>
          </div>

          <!-- 아툴 전투 점수 및 딜 스탯 정보 (토글 '아툴 점수' 시 노출) -->
          <div class="dps-stats-info" id="dps-stats-info" style="display: none; margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding: 1.5rem; background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9); border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.35); border-radius: 14px;">
            <!-- 데바니온 반영 점수/스탯 계산 중 로딩 오버레이 -->
            <div class="dps-loading-overlay" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="dps-loading-spinner"></div>
              <span>계산 중...</span>
            </div>
            <!-- 아툴 전투 점수 표시 -->
            <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding-bottom: 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);">
              
              <div style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
                <span>아툴 전투 점수 (PVE 딜 세팅 점수)</span>
                <!-- <button id="dps-calculation-info-btn" style="width: 20px; height: 20px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(157, 140, 255, 0.2); border: 1px solid rgba(157, 140, 255, 0.4); color: #a78bfa; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; transition: all 0.2s ease; padding: 0;" title="전투 점수 계산 방식 보기" onclick="showDpsCalculationModal();">?</button> -->
              </div>
              <!-- 달성 최고 점수 -->
              <div id="combat-score-max-info" style="display: none; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; text-align: center;"></div>
